# St. Wolfgang's Hackl (power-up, D-056): a small woodcutter's hatchet
# standing upright, blade to the top right. Blade i with m/d shading toward the
# bottom-right edge and a 1 px w glint that slides down the blade on frame 1;
# handle O with l shade, its top end showing above the eye; k outline. Short
# handle, deep rounded blade: a tool, not a weapon. Never gold and round.
sprite = hackl
size   = 16x16
origin = 8,16
hitbox = 4,1,10,15
anim   = idle frames=2 ticks=20 loop
